flowchart TB
  Goal[User goal and grants] --> Plan[Mock or model planner]
  Adapter[Shared model adapter] --> Plan
  Plan --> Validate[Bounded plan and argument validation]
  Validate --> Permission[Caller grants intersect registry]
  Registry[Arithmetic and text_stats registry] --> Permission
  Permission --> Execute[Timed local tool execution]
  Execute --> Feedback[Owned step outcomes and history]
  Feedback --> User[Response to user]
  Cancel[Cancellation or deadline] --> Execute
